---
---
<section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="col" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow accent">About</p>
      <h2 id="about-h">Regulated services are where design earns its keep.</h2>
      <div class="bio">
        <p>I am Oluwayemi Akinbande, a Senior Service &amp; UX Designer based in Calgary, Canada. Seven years of work across fintech, healthcare, energy and SaaS, and a specialism in services that are government-funded, regulated, or used by the public.</p>
        <p>The work I am best at is the unglamorous kind: intake that stands up to audit, operations platforms that a whole organisation runs on, design systems that a team keeps using after handoff. I design the service model and the information architecture before the interface, and I stay through to production code so the spec and the shipped product are the same thing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:hello@yemmy.design">hello@yemmy.design</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/akinoluwayemi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col facts" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.15">
      <dl class="panel list">
        <div><dt>Availability</dt><dd><span class="pill" data-status="live">Open</span> Senior service and UX design roles in Canada or remote, and selected contracts.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Based</dt><dd>Calgary, Alberta. Mountain Time.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Working hours overlap</dt><dd class="clocks mono" id="clocks">
          <span data-tz="America/Edmonton">Calgary <b>--:--</b></span>
          <span data-tz="America/Toronto">Toronto <b>--:--</b></span>
          <span data-tz="Europe/London">London <b>--:--</b></span>
          <span data-tz="Australia/Sydney">Sydney <b>--:--</b></span>
        </dd></div>
        <div><dt>Standards</dt><dd>WCAG 2.2 AA, design tokens, component libraries, design governance.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Sectors</dt><dd>Government-funded care, digital government, healthcare, fintech, energy, SaaS.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  function tick() {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('#clocks [data-tz]').forEach((el) => {
      const b = el.querySelector('b'); if (!b) return;
      b.textContent = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB', { timeZone: el.dataset.tz, hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', hour12: false }).format(new Date());
    });
  }
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => { tick(); setInterval(tick, 30000); });
</script>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr); gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: start; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 44px); margin: 14px 0 22px; max-width: 16ch; }
  .bio { display: grid; gap: 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 58ch; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 30px; }
  .list { margin: 0; padding: 6px 0; }
  .list > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-a); }
  .list > div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  dt { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); padding-top: 3px; }
  dd { margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg); }
  dd .pill { margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
  .clocks { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .clocks b { font-weight: 500; color: var(--fg); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .list > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; } }
</style>
